ideoButton__overviewVideoButton__d9DBl ActionVideo__videoBtn__bsfVJ\"><span class=\"sr-only\">play</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" svg-inline role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.24 12a14.32 14.32 0 0127.52 0h1.74a16 16 0 00-31 0zm27.52 8a14.32 14.32 0 01-27.52 0H.5a16 16 0 0031 0z\"></path></svg></button> <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Open-Ear Gaming Earbuds? Meet the ROG Cetra Open Wireless\" class=\"ActionVideo__videoImage__MDnor\" style=\"background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/eKYse7R6Eag/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">Open-Ear Gaming Earbuds? Meet the ROG Cetra Open Wireless</p></div></li><li class=\"ActionVideo__actionVideoContent__VSBOn ActionVideo__reviewVideo__ItQ8T ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewItem__r730n\"><button type=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"VideoButton__videoButton__XVz9e VideoButton__overviewVideoButton__d9DBl ActionVideo__videoBtn__bsfVJ\"><span class=\"sr-only\">play</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" svg-inline role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.24 12a14.32 14.32 0 0127.52 0h1.74a16 16 0 00-31 0zm27.52 8a14.32 14.32 0 01-27.52 0H.5a16 16 0 0031 0z\"></path></svg></button> <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"It's a great format for sports, and it's very comfortable for gaming sessions. For a streamer who sits for five, six, or more hours and doesn't want anything pressing on their head.\" class=\"ActionVideo__videoImage__MDnor\" style=\"background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/PPOfiGPV0qM/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">It's a great format for sports, and it's very comfortable for gaming sessions. For a streamer who sits for five, six, or more hours and doesn't want anything pressing on their head.</p></div></li><li class=\"ActionVideo__actionVideoContent__VSBOn ActionVideo__reviewVideo__ItQ8T ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewItem__r730n\"><button type=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"VideoButton__videoButton__XVz9e VideoButton__overviewVideoButton__d9DBl ActionVideo__videoBtn__bsfVJ\"><span class=\"sr-only\">play</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" svg-inline role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.24 12a14.32 14.32 0 0127.52 0h1.74a16 16 0 00-31 0zm27.52 8a14.32 14.32 0 01-27.52 0H.5a16 16 0 0031 0z\"></path></svg></button> <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"This device is for active gamers who are a little older—people who need to work, work out, just listen to music, have a drink, and play games—all with a single device.\" class=\"ActionVideo__videoImage__MDnor\" style=\"background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/9KZxGgwAFf0/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">This device is for active gamers who are a little older—people who need to work, work out, just listen to music, have a drink, and play games—all with a single device.</p></div></li><li class=\"ActionVideo__actionVideoContent__VSBOn ActionVideo__reviewVideo__ItQ8T ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewItem__r730n\"><button type=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"VideoButton__videoButton__XVz9e VideoButton__overviewVideoButton__d9DBl ActionVideo__videoBtn__bsfVJ\"><span class=\"sr-only\">play</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" svg-inline role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.24 12a14.32 14.32 0 0127.52 0h1.74a16 16 0 00-31 0zm27.52 8a14.32 14.32 0 01-27.52 0H.5a16 16 0 0031 0z\"></path></svg></button> <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"These are probably the best headphones of this form factor that I've ever tested.\" class=\"ActionVideo__videoImage__MDnor\" style=\"background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/4FW-AuVbA-Y/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">These are probably the best headphones of this form factor that I've ever tested.</p></div></li></ul></div> <ul class=\"ProductAwardVideo__awardVideoMoreContainer__hZyzH\"></ul></div> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-media\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Media_review\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__productAwardPagePadding__LFeX-\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__line__Z71fT\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaTitle__t55HQ\"><h2 class=\"pageMedia vnRogFont ProductAwardMedia__vnRogFontSize__ARdRa\">\n        Media review\n      </h2> <span style=\"display:;\">(6)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__mobileMediaContent__C6DyG\"><ul class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaContainer__M6cwI\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"IGN\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1339/202311151721280440651.jpg);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      Asus is basically creating a new niche here and one that I have personally been waiting for. I play games most days for work but I need to be able to hear what's going on around me, whether that's my wife talking, a delivery at the front door, or a crying baby. I find earbuds more comfortable than headsets but &quot;transparency modes&quot; on existing gaming earbuds are universally terrible. Open earbuds – so-named because they sit outside your ear canal – are far better for hearing what's happening.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      IGN\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>UNITED KINGDOM</span> <span>03/25/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Cetra Open Wireless Gaming Earbuds media of IGN\" href=\"https://www.ign.com/articles/asus-rog-cetra-open-wireless-gaming-earbuds-review\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Score\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1261/202205091652439070934.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      Do you want regular wireless earbuds? You can easily get by with the classic Cetra. You don't like earbuds, but you don't want to wear full-sized headphones on your head at work/in public/during sports, or you just need to maintain awareness of your surroundings while listening? Look no further.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Score\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>05/21/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Cetra Open Wireless Gaming Earbuds media of Score\" href=\"https://www.score.cz/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"CzechGamer.com\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1261/202205091652439070934.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      The ASUS ROG Cetra Open Wireless are niche headphones that only make sense if you know exactly why you want an open-ear design. For running, sports, gaming at home, or situations where you need to hear your surroundings, they work very well in my opinion. In games, the low latency, wide soundstage, and emphasis on subtle audio details really help.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      CzechGamer.com\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>06/12/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Cetra Open Wireless Gaming Earbuds media of CzechGamer.com\" href=\"https://www.czechgamer.com/43162/rog-cetra-open-recenze.html\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ITsider\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1353/202106242119562680229.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      ASUS has essentially brought the features characteristic of the ROG series to the open-back headphone category, offering a comfortable fit, a recognizable design, and truly impressive battery life.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      ITsider\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>UKRAINE</span> <span>07/24/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Cetra Open Wireless Gaming Earbuds media of ITsider\" href=\"https://itsider.com.ua/oglyad-asus-rog-cetra-open-wireless/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"absolutegeeks.com\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1354/202009040028298470053.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      open-ear comfort with proper low-latency gaming connectivity\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      absolutegeeks.com\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>UNITED ARAB EMIRATES</span> <span>09/30/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Cetra Open Wireless Gaming Earbuds media of absolutegeeks.com\" href=\"https://www.absolutegeeks.com/reviews/rog-cetra-open-wireless-earbuds-review-open-ear-gaming-comes-at-a-price/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Gamepress.cz\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202402131958121890599.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      However, ASUS offers something truly exceptional: the comfort of an open-ear design combined with a high-quality, low-latency gaming connection. If this combination appeals to you, the Cetra Open Wireless earbuds are among the most interesting gaming audio products I've tested recently.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Gamepress.cz\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>10/06/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Cetra Open Wireless Gaming Earbuds media of Gamepress.cz\" href=\"https://gamepress.cz/recenze-asus-rog-centra-open-wireless-otevrena-bezdratova-gamingova-sluchatka/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__rewardMoreButton__7-dJ4\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Media review\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" svg-inline alt role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 9.55l-5-5V2.5l5 5 5-5v2.05l-5 5z\" fill=\"#181818\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div> <script type=\"application/javascript\" src=\"https://rog.asus.com/rog/nuxtStatic/js/overview.js\"></script> <!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div> <!----> <!----></div></main>"}